00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,932
The tools ran. The agent still broke. PatchCourt makes a silent SDK regression visible. This is
a recorded replay of an actual DeepSeek Flash

2
00:00:09,932 --> 00:00:14,070
development run. Playback makes no new model or search requests.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:24,066
The saved experiment used DeepSeek Flash through its development API. Its model read the
historical adapter and proposed a restricted field mapping.

4
00:00:24,066 --> 00:00:32,720
Watch the recorded stages reveal the missing tool calls, the proposal, independent
verification, and the recovered task. Playback timing is editorial;

5
00:00:32,720 --> 00:00:34,780
the source requests are preserved.

6
00:00:36,000 --> 00:00:44,134
The returned mapping is data, never executable model generated Python. Eight independent checks
preserve identifiers, multiple calls, nested

7
00:00:44,134 --> 00:00:53,624
arguments, ordinary messages, and legacy behavior. We deliberately corrupt the identifiers too.
That repair must be rejected. The model cannot approve

8
00:00:53,624 --> 00:00:54,980
its own work.

9
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:05,184
The actual source conversation called two local fixture tools. Inventory returned three items.
Price returned seven per item. The original adapter

10
00:01:05,184 --> 00:01:13,930
dropped the calls. The verified mapping preserved their identities, and the model returned the
independently checked inventory value: twenty one.

11
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:25,400
The saved report records the exact model, returned identities, 3 model requests, and 4094
reported tokens. Tavily retrieved official documentation for

12
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:35,799
this repair proposal. We retain source hashes, request records, negative controls, and rejected
attempts. Successful API use alone is not evidence

13
00:01:35,799 --> 00:01:37,780
that retrieval improved accuracy.

14
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:47,467
This demonstration covers a bounded adapter repair and fixed local tools, not arbitrary
production patching. The adapter uses audited historical

15
00:01:47,467 --> 00:01:55,933
source and inert SDK message types. This development provider does not satisfy the
competition's separate NVIDIA and Nebius runtime requirement.

16
00:01:55,933 --> 00:02:00,590
Hashes protect local integrity; they do not independently authenticate the provider.

17
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:11,813
PatchCourt connects a concrete failure, a model proposal, an independent verdict, and a
recovered task. Inspect the source and the saved evidence. A

18
00:02:11,813 --> 00:02:16,080
convincing repair earns trust through execution, not a confident explanation.
